# WOR-144 COMPLETE: Frontend connects to Real API

## Status: DONE ✅

## Completion Date: 2026-05-03

## Work Summary

The frontend at port 8765 now connects to the real API backend running on port 8080 instead of using hardcoded `generateMockWorld()` mock data.

## Changes Made

### 1. `web/api-integration.js`
- Updated `API_BASE` from 'http://localhost:3000' to 'http://localhost:8080/api/v1'
- Implemented `WorldFactoryAPI` class with real API methods
- Added mock fallbacks for resilience when API is unavailable

### 2. `web/index.html`
- Updated `fetchPlanetData()` to use `worldAPI.createWorld()` and `worldAPI.getPlanetData()`
- Updated `loadWorld()` to use `worldAPI.getMapData()` for real polygon data
- Added `determineBiomeFromPolygon()` helper that maps API data to frontend biomes
- Added polygon transformation to convert API format to frontend format

